Third-party material

The following are not the work of Krautlabs Inc. and are NOT licensed under
CC BY-NC 4.0 by Krautlabs Inc. They remain under their sources' own terms, as
documented in SOURCES.md:

  - data/bundeslaender.topo.json, data/kulisse.topo.json (geometry):
    Eurostat GISCO / (c) EuroGeographics -- non-commercial use only, with the
    attribution "(c) EuroGeographics bezüglich der Verwaltungsgrenzen".
  - data/bundeslaender.json (the Bundesland facts; population and area from
    Statistisches Bundesamt (Destatis)) -- reproduction and distribution
    permitted with attribution.
  - wappen/ (the Landeswappen): Public Domain, subject to the insignia law
    (Wappengesetz) of each Bundesland, which restricts their use independently
    of copyright.
  - data/gewaesser.topo.json, data/staedte.json (river, lake and city
    geometry): derived from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
    available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0 --
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/ ; see also
    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright . These two files are licensed
    under the ODbL only, and anyone may use them under its terms.
  - data/landmarks.json (the river, lake and city facts): lengths, areas and
    depths from Wikidata (CC0), checked against de.wikipedia; population from
    Statistisches Bundesamt (Destatis) -- reproduction and distribution
    permitted with attribution. Names, articles and pool flags are the work of
    Krautlabs Inc.

data/bundesland-aliases.json and data/landmark-aliases.json are the work of
Krautlabs Inc. and are covered by the CC BY-NC 4.0 licence above.
